{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">運輸及物流局局長陳美寶指，本港刷新貨船裝卸貨物紀錄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳美寶在社交網站指，香港海港聯盟日前為地中海航運公司的一隻超大型貨櫃船，在80小時內處理8,335次貨櫃裝卸，較一般處理量多一倍，在作業高峰期平均每部吊機每小時處理逾24次裝卸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PORT-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jOZ3JhyJQq1788326938.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PORT-1230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳美寶指創下新紀錄，體現碼頭調度、後勤協調及應對龐大吞吐量需求時的高效操作與穩健實力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T05:44:03.256199+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}